<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6 From Tangible to Intangible: Reimagining Conceptual Blending ‣ Blending Concepts with Text-to-Image Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Architecture</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
